      "description": "These are the slider positions, published on the control topic and applied by the services. They are deliberately on their own panel: a consumer asked for 200/s that spends 20ms of simulated work per message achieves 50/s, so plotting a request beside an achievement without saying which is which teaches the reader something false. Compare this panel with the one above; where they disagree, the difference is the work delay and the broker.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "kafka-lab-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
