      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Control records applied, and hot-path errors",
      "description": "How to tell 'the slider did nothing' from 'the slider's message never arrived'. Every settings record a service reads from the control topic bumps its applied counter; if you drag a slider and no line steps here, the record did not reach that service.",
